    `the number of shares already issued under the resolution` IS A NUMBER
    `the number of shares in this issue`                       IS A NUMBER
    `the day of this issue`                                    IS A DATE
    `the consideration for this issue`                         IS A NUMBER
    `the stock is issued to the person or body that issues it` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref 8 Del. C. § 152(b) (src:486)
