GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 152(c) the provision may be made dependent on facts ascertainable outside the resolution` `the resolution is one contemplated by subsection (a) or (b)` `a provision depends on facts ascertainable outside the resolution` `the resolution clearly and expressly sets forth the manner in which the facts operate on the resolution` MEANS
        `the resolution is one contemplated by subsection (a) or (b)`
    AND (    (NOT `a provision depends on facts ascertainable outside the resolution`)
