        `the stock was issued in accordance with section 152`
    AND `the corporation has received the consideration`
    AND (NOT `the board issued the shares as partly paid under section 156`)

-- Section 152(e): the minimum consideration for which shares may be issued may not be less than the consideration (if any) that section 153 requires.
-- Section 153 requires, for shares with a par value, consideration of at least their aggregate par value, and requires nothing for shares without par value.
