    WHEN NOTHING THEN TRUE
    WHEN JUST required THEN `the minimum consideration fixed for the shares` AT LEAST required

§ `Section 153: consideration for stock`

-- The consideration (if any) that section 153 requires for a number of shares: for shares with a par value, a value not less than their aggregate par value (section 153(a));
-- for shares without par value nothing is required (section 153(b)), which is NOTHING here.
-- src:493 | Shares of stock with par value may be issued for such consideration, having a value not less than the par value of the shares so issued, as determined from time to time in accordance with § 152 of this title, or by the stockholders if the certificate of incorporation so provides.
-- src:494 | Shares of stock without par value may be issued for such consideration as is determined from time to time in accordance with § 152 of this title, or by the stockholders if the certificate of incorporation so provides.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 153(a) (src:493); § 153(b) (src:494)
GIVEN `the shares have a par value` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the par value of each share` IS A NUMBER
      `the number of shares` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`s 153 the consideration required for the shares, if any` `the shares have a par value` `the par value of each share` `the number of shares` MEANS
    IF `the shares have a par value`
    THEN JUST (`the par value of each share` TIMES `the number of shares`)
    ELSE NOTHING

-- Who may determine the consideration: the board under section 152, or the stockholders if the certificate so provides.
-- src:493 | as determined from time to time in accordance with § 152 of this title, or by the stockholders if the certificate of incorporation so provides.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 153(a) (src:493)
DECLARE `s 153 Who determines the consideration` IS ONE OF
    `the board of directors under s 152`
    `the stockholders under s 153`

-- Shares with par value: the consideration must have a value not less than the aggregate par value of the shares issued, as determined by the board under section 152
-- or by the stockholders if the certificate of incorporation so provides.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 153(a) (src:493)
GIVEN `the value of the consideration` IS A NUMBER
      `the aggregate par value of the shares issued` IS A NUMBER
      `who determined the consideration` IS A `s 153 Who determines the consideration`
      `the certificate of incorporation provides that the stockholders determine the consideration` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 153(a) the shares with par value may be issued for the consideration` `the value of the consideration` `the aggregate par value of the shares issued` `who determined the consideration` `the certificate of incorporation provides that the stockholders determine the consideration` MEANS
        `the value of the consideration` AT LEAST `the aggregate par value of the shares issued`
    AND (    `who determined the consideration` EQUALS `the board of directors under s 152`
         OR  (    `who determined the consideration` EQUALS `the stockholders under s 153`
              AND `the certificate of incorporation provides that the stockholders determine the consideration`))

-- Shares without par value: for such consideration as is determined in accordance with section 152, or by the stockholders if the certificate so provides.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 153(b) (src:494)
GIVEN `who determined the consideration` IS A `s 153 Who determines the consideration`
      `the certificate of incorporation provides that the stockholders determine the consideration` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 153(b) the shares without par value may be issued for the consideration` `who determined the consideration` `the certificate of incorporation provides that the stockholders determine the consideration` MEANS
        `who determined the consideration` EQUALS `the board of directors under s 152`
    OR  (    `who determined the consideration` EQUALS `the stockholders under s 153`
         AND `the certificate of incorporation provides that the stockholders determine the consideration`)

-- Treasury shares may be disposed of in the same manner that shares are issued under section 152(a) to (d), or for the consideration the stockholders determine if the certificate so provides.
-- The consideration may be greater than, less than or equal to par value and may be cash, property or any benefit to the corporation, or a combination.
-- src:495 | Treasury shares may be disposed of by the corporation in the same manner that shares of stock are issued pursuant to § 152(a) through (d) of this title, or may be disposed of for such consideration as determined by the stockholders if the certificate of incorporation so provides. The consideration received for treasury shares may have a value greater or less than, or equal to, the par value (if any) of such shares and may consist of cash, any tangible or intangible property or any benefit to the corporation, or any combination thereof.
-- src:495 | The consideration received for treasury shares may have a value greater or less than, or equal to, the par value (if any) of such shares and may consist of cash, any tangible or intangible property or any benefit to the corporation, or any combination thereof.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 153(c) (src:495)
