GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 157(d) the matter is a fact for the purposes of that section` `the matter is the occurrence of an event, including a determination or action by any person or body (the corporation included)` MEANS
    IF `the matter is the occurrence of an event, including a determination or action by any person or body (the corporation included)`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING

-- src:515 | provided that, if the resolution delegates to a person or body the authority to enter into 1 or more transactions to issue rights or options pursuant to subsection (c) of this section, the provisions contemplated by paragraphs (c)(i) through (iii) of this section may not be made dependent on a determination or action by such person or body.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 157(d) (src:515)
GIVEN `the resolution delegates to a person or body the authority to issue rights or options under subsection (c)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the provision on the maximum number, the time periods or the minimum consideration is made dependent on a determination or action by that person or body` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 157(d) the limits fixed under subsection (c) may be made dependent on the delegate` `the resolution delegates to a person or body the authority to issue rights or options under subsection (c)` `the provision on the maximum number, the time periods or the minimum consideration is made dependent on a determination or action by that person or body` MEANS
    NOT (    `the resolution delegates to a person or body the authority to issue rights or options under subsection (c)`
         AND `the provision on the maximum number, the time periods or the minimum consideration is made dependent on a determination or action by that person or body`)

-- Section 157(e): the minimum consideration for shares issued on exercise may be no less than the consideration (if any) that section 153 requires.
-- src:516 | The minimum consideration for which shares of stock of the corporation may be issued upon exercise of such rights or options shall be no less than the consideration (if any) required by § 153 of this title.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 157(e) (src:516)
GIVEN `the minimum consideration fixed for the shares issuable on exercise` IS A NUMBER
      `the consideration section 153 requires for the shares, if any` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 157(e) the minimum consideration on exercise is not less than that section 153 requires` `the minimum consideration fixed for the shares issuable on exercise` `the consideration section 153 requires for the shares, if any` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the consideration section 153 requires for the shares, if any`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN TRUE
