§ `Section 158: stock certificates; uncertificated shares`

-- Shares are represented by certificates, but the board may resolve that some or all of any or all classes or series are uncertificated.
-- A resolution does not apply to shares represented by a certificate until the certificate is surrendered to the corporation.
-- src:520 | The shares of a corporation shall be represented by certificates, provided that the board of directors of the corporation may provide by resolution or resolutions that some or all of any or all classes or series of its stock shall be uncertificated shares. Any such resolution shall not apply to shares represented by a certificate until such certificate is surrendered to the corporation. Every holder of stock represented by certificates shall be entitled to have a certificate signed by, or in the name of, the corporation by any 2 authorized officers of the corporation representing the number of shares registered in certificate form. Any or all the signatures on the certificate may be a facsimile. In case any officer, transfer agent or registrar who has signed or whose facsimile signature has been placed upon a certificate shall have ceased to be such officer, transfer agent or registrar before such certificate is issued, it may be issued by the corporation with the same effect as if such person were such officer, transfer agent or registrar at the date of issue. A corporation shall not have power to issue a certificate in bearer form.
-- src:520 | Any such resolution shall not apply to shares represented by a certificate until such certificate is surrendered to the corporation. Every holder of stock represented by certificates shall be entitled to have a certificate signed by, or in the name of, the corporation by any 2 authorized officers of the corporation representing the number of shares registered in certificate form. Any or all the signatures on the certificate may be a facsimile. In case any officer, transfer agent or registrar who has signed or whose facsimile signature has been placed upon a certificate shall have ceased to be such officer, transfer agent or registrar before such certificate is issued, it may be issued by the corporation with the same effect as if such person were such officer, transfer agent or registrar at the date of issue. A corporation shall not have power to issue a certificate in bearer form.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 158 (src:520)
GIVEN `the board resolved that the shares of the class or series are to be uncertificated` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the shares are represented by a certificate` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the certificate has been surrendered to the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 158 the shares are uncertificated shares` `the board resolved that the shares of the class or series are to be uncertificated` `the shares are represented by a certificate` `the certificate has been surrendered to the corporation` MEANS
        `the board resolved that the shares of the class or series are to be uncertificated`
    AND (    (NOT `the shares are represented by a certificate`)
         OR  `the certificate has been surrendered to the corporation`)

-- Every holder of stock represented by certificates is entitled to a certificate signed by, or in the name of, the corporation by any 2 authorised officers,
-- representing the number of shares registered in certificate form. Any or all signatures may be a facsimile. A signature counts even if the officer, transfer agent or registrar
-- who signed (or whose facsimile was placed) has ceased to be one before the certificate is issued ("any 2" is read as at least 2: Fork F5).
-- src:520 | Every holder of stock represented by certificates shall be entitled to have a certificate signed by, or in the name of, the corporation by any 2 authorized officers of the corporation representing the number of shares registered in certificate form. Any or all the signatures on the certificate may be a facsimile. In case any officer, transfer agent or registrar who has signed or whose facsimile signature has been placed upon a certificate shall have ceased to be such officer, transfer agent or registrar before such certificate is issued, it may be issued by the corporation with the same effect as if such person were such officer, transfer agent or registrar at the date of issue. A corporation shall not have power to issue a certificate in bearer form.
-- src:520 | Any or all the signatures on the certificate may be a facsimile. In case any officer, transfer agent or registrar who has signed or whose facsimile signature has been placed upon a certificate shall have ceased to be such officer, transfer agent or registrar before such certificate is issued, it may be issued by the corporation with the same effect as if such person were such officer, transfer agent or registrar at the date of issue. A corporation shall not have power to issue a certificate in bearer form.
-- src:520 | it may be issued by the corporation with the same effect as if such person were such officer, transfer agent or registrar at the date of issue. A corporation shall not have power to issue a certificate in bearer form.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 158 (src:520)
GIVEN `the holder holds stock represented by certificates` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 158 the holder is entitled to a certificate` `the holder holds stock represented by certificates` MEANS
    `the holder holds stock represented by certificates`

@ref 8 Del. C. § 158 (src:520)
GIVEN `the number of authorised officers who signed the certificate or in whose name it was issued, counting facsimile signatures and signers who ceased to be officers before issue` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 158 the certificate is signed as the section requires` `the number of authorised officers who signed the certificate or in whose name it was issued, counting facsimile signatures and signers who ceased to be officers before issue` MEANS
    `the number of authorised officers who signed the certificate or in whose name it was issued, counting facsimile signatures and signers who ceased to be officers before issue` AT LEAST 2

-- A corporation shall not have power to issue a certificate in bearer form.
-- src:520 | A corporation shall not have power to issue a certificate in bearer form.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 158 (src:520)
GIVEN `the certificate is in bearer form` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 158 the corporation has power to issue the certificate` `the certificate is in bearer form` MEANS
    NOT `the certificate is in bearer form`

§ `Section 161: issuance of additional stock; when and by whom`

-- The directors may at any time, if all the shares the certificate of incorporation authorises have not been issued, subscribed for or otherwise committed to be issued,
-- issue or take subscriptions for additional shares up to the amount authorised.
-- src:543 | The directors may, at any time and from time to time, if all of the shares of capital stock which the corporation is authorized by its certificate of incorporation to issue have not been issued, subscribed for, or otherwise committed to be issued, issue or take subscriptions for additional shares of its capital stock up to the amount authorized in its certificate of incorporation.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 161 (src:543)
GIVEN `the number of shares the certificate of incorporation authorises` IS A NUMBER
      `the number of shares already issued, subscribed for or otherwise committed to be issued` IS A NUMBER
      `the number of additional shares` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 161 the directors may issue or take subscriptions for the additional shares` `the number of shares the certificate of incorporation authorises` `the number of shares already issued, subscribed for or otherwise committed to be issued` `the number of additional shares` MEANS
        (`the number of shares already issued, subscribed for or otherwise committed to be issued` LESS THAN `the number of shares the certificate of incorporation authorises`)
    AND ((`the number of shares already issued, subscribed for or otherwise committed to be issued` PLUS `the number of additional shares`) AT MOST `the number of shares the certificate of incorporation authorises`)
